#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with "
"quantum computing and want to learn how to write variational algorithms "
"using Qiskit Runtime primitives. It is also suitable for quantum computing "
"professionals who want to expand their knowledge and skills in the field of "
"variational algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este curso está dirigido a personas que ya tienen experiencia en computación"
" cuántica y desean aprender a escribir algoritmos variacionales con Qiskit "
"Runtime Primitives. También es adecuado para profesionales de la computación"
" cuántica que deseen ampliar sus conocimientos y habilidades en el área de "
"algoritmos variacionales.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Examen {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Variational algorithm design, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the "
"lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by "
"Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para obtener tu insignia de Variational algorithm design, realiza el examen "
"en IBM&reg; Training. Este examen está diseñado para realizarse después de "
"leer las lecciones de este curso. Tras aprobar el examen, Credly te "
"notificará que has obtenido una insignia.\n"

